{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-samana-santorini","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"santorini-samana-developers-dubai-studio-city","about":"Samana Santorini is a premium class complex in Dubai City Studio, developed by Samana. The project is a 5-storey apartment building located in a prestigious multifunctional community that has become famous for its commercial focus in the entertainment industry. The complex is designed in the Greek style: snow-white buildings are combined with azure pools and an abundance of greenery, and roofs with gazebos encourage a leisurely and peaceful lifestyle.The complex consists of 157 exclusive residences, including studios and apartments with 1-3 bedrooms. All residences are decorated with premium materials of high quality, there are panoramic windows and spacious balconies with spectacular views. The 2-bedroom apartment has a private pool.The apartments in the complex will provide residents with many first-class amenities, including: a health club, exotic water features, an outdoor cinema, a yoga room, a communal pool and pools on terraces, a Jacuzzi, a barbecue area, parking.In addition, a wide range of retail outlets, catering establishments and many other commercial facilities can be found here.The complex is perfect for families with children. In fact, this is a spacious playground for playing in a children's pool, and a 5-10-minute drive from the hotel are the Blossom Damak Hills Kindergarten, Victory Heights Elementary School and the Royal Guildford Gymnasium in Dubai.","price":null,"title":"Samana Santorini","bitrix":{"id":958,"pf_id":"are.2.12161","source":null,"project_id":"Samana Santorini","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Samana Santorini","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Samana Developers","project_location":"Dubai Studio City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/321/images/2023